    "只保存项目类型、你的选择和模型评价；不保存文件内容或完整路径。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Stores only item types, your choices, and model feedback—not file contents or full paths." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "只儲存項目類型、你的選擇和模型評價；不儲存檔案內容或完整路徑。" } } } },
