    "先完成一次空间扫描，再对某个项目选择“以后优先清理”或“以后优先保留”。CleanNest 会把这条理由带到下一次扫描，而不是只给你三个没有意义的 0。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Run a storage scan, then mark an item to prioritize cleaning or keeping. CleanNest carries that reason into the next scan instead of showing three meaningless zeroes." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "先完成一次空間掃描，再對某個項目選擇「以後優先清理」或「以後優先保留」。CleanNest 會把這條理由帶到下一次掃描，而不是只給你三個沒有意義的 0。" } } } },
    "清理空间" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Clean Up" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "清理空間" } } } },
