    "状态与磁盘分析需要 Mole CLI。你可以在 App 内免费安装，不必打开终端。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "System status and disk analysis use Mole CLI. Install it free inside the app—no Terminal required." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "狀態與磁碟分析需要 Mole CLI。你可以在 App 內免費安裝，不必開啟終端機。" } } } },
    "去设置" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open Settings" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "前往設定" } } } },
    "磁盘浏览。从文件夹大小出发，找到空间真正去了哪里。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Disk Browser. Start with folder sizes and find where your space really went." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "磁碟瀏覽。從資料夾大小出發，找出空間真正去了哪裡。" } } } },
    "从文件夹大小出发，找到空间真正去了哪里。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Start with folder sizes and find where your space really went." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "從資料夾大小出發，找出空間真正去了哪裡。" } } } },
    "选择文件夹" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Choose Folder" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "選擇資料夾" } } } },
    "开始分析" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Analyze" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "開始分析" } } } },
