    "正在建立用途与可清理性证据" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Building purpose and cleanup evidence" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "正在建立用途與可清理性證據" } } } },
    "正在计算当前层级" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Calculating this level" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "正在計算目前層級" } } } },
    "空间分布" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Space Distribution" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "空間分布" } } } },
    "浏览页保持只读" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Disk Browser Stays Read-only" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "瀏覽頁維持唯讀" } } } },
    "首版不会从任意文件夹直接删除内容。请先在 Finder 中确认，或使用“清理空间”里的安全范围。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This view never deletes from arbitrary folders. Confirm in Finder or use the guarded Clean Up scope." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "此頁不會從任意資料夾直接刪除內容。請先在 Finder 中確認，或使用「清理空間」的安全範圍。" } } } },
    "系统状态。本机采样；不上传指标，只在你确认后结束所选进程。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "System Status. Sampled locally; metrics are not uploaded, and selected processes stop only after confirmation." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "系統狀態。本機採樣；不上傳指標，只在你確認後結束所選程序。" } } } },
    "本机采样；不上传指标，只在你确认后结束所选进程。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Sampled locally; metrics are not uploaded, and selected processes stop only after confirmation." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "本機採樣；不上傳指標，只在你確認後結束所選程序。" } } } },
