    "设置。引擎、权限与扫描范围都由你掌控。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Settings. You control the engine, permissions, and scan scope." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "設定。引擎、權限與掃描範圍都由你掌控。" } } } },
    "引擎、权限与扫描范围都由你掌控。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "You control the engine, permissions, and scan scope." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "引擎、權限與掃描範圍都由你掌控。" } } } },
