    "当前构建没有可比较的版本号。请使用打包后的 CleanNest.app 检查更新。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This build has no comparable version. Use a packaged CleanNest.app to check for updates." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "目前構建沒有可比較的版本號。請使用打包後的 CleanNest.app 檢查更新。" } } } },
