    "保存设置后即可检测，无需打开终端。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Save these settings to check the model—no Terminal required." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "儲存設定後即可檢測，無需開啟終端機。" } } } },
