    "到期样本自动清理，不影响当前系统状态。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Expired samples are removed automatically without affecting current system status." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "到期樣本會自動清理，不影響目前系統狀態。" } } } },
