    "可读取：最新状态、历史趋势、内存进程、磁盘证据、清理预览和活动记录。客户端权限仍由你自己的 MCP 配置控制。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Readable data: latest status, metric history, memory processes, disk evidence, cleanup preview, and activity log. Client access remains controlled by your MCP configuration." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "可讀取：最新狀態、歷史趨勢、記憶體程序、磁碟證據、清理預覽與活動記錄。用戶端權限仍由你自己的 MCP 設定控制。" } } } },
