    "等待返回…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Waiting for Return…" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "等待返回…" } } } },
    "打开系统设置" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open System Settings" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "開啟系統設定" } } } },
    "CleanNest 自身的访问测试已通过。这是当前实际读取结果，不是“打开系统设置”的成功回执。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "CleanNest's own access probe passed. This is a real read result, not confirmation that System Settings merely opened." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "CleanNest 自身的存取測試已通過。這是目前實際讀取結果，不是「開啟系統設定」的成功回執。" } } } },
    "不可关闭" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Always On" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "不可關閉" } } } },
    "当前所有原生清理与卸载操作只移到废纸篓。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "All native cleanup and uninstall actions currently move items to Trash only." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "目前所有原生清理與解除安裝操作只會移到垃圾桶。" } } } },
    "已开启" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Enabled" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "已開啟" } } } },
    "为避免越过允许目录，符号链接目标一律跳过。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Symbolic-link targets are always skipped to stay inside allowed folders." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "為避免越過允許目錄，符號連結目標一律略過。" } } } },
    "扫描 Xcode、Homebrew、npm 与 pip 的可再生成缓存。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Scan regenerable Xcode, Homebrew, npm, and pip caches." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "掃描 Xcode、Homebrew、npm 與 pip 的可重新產生快取。" } } } },
    "默认关闭；开启后只展示，不会自动勾选。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Off by default. When enabled, items are shown but never selected automatically." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "預設關閉；開啟後只顯示，不會自動勾選。" } } } },
    "磁盘浏览可以手动选择外接卷；后台自动扫描保持关闭。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Disk Browser can open an external volume manually; background auto-scanning remains off." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "磁碟瀏覽可手動選擇外接卷宗；背景自動掃描維持關閉。" } } } },
    "手动选择" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Manual Selection" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "手動選擇" } } } },
    "独立、可修改的原生 macOS 客户端。不是 Mole 官方 App，也不使用官方图标。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "An independent, modifiable native macOS client. It is not an official Mole app and does not use Mole's icon." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "獨立、可修改的原生 macOS 用戶端。不是 Mole 官方 App，也不使用官方圖示。" } } } },
    "可选引擎：Mole CLI，由 tw93 与贡献者维护，GPL-3.0。CleanNest 不捆绑其二进制。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Optional engine: Mole CLI, maintained by tw93 and contributors under GPL-3.0. CleanNest does not bundle its binary." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "可選引擎：Mole CLI，由 tw93 與貢獻者維護，採 GPL-3.0。CleanNest 不綑綁其二進位檔。" } } } },
